cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Please cite the EPC research report using the manuscript title."
title: "A Bounded Software Model for Deterministic Contract Execution and Replay"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-15
abstract: >-
  An evidence-bounded report on contract-based deterministic software
  execution, controlled replay, and a deterministic abstract simulator.
  Results are limited to a ten-process replay test and three synthetic
  workloads on one x64 host. No hardware-prediction or novelty claim is made.
license: LicenseRef-All-Rights-Reserved
keywords:
  - deterministic execution
  - software replay
  - execution contracts
  - abstract simulation
